t></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0.139em; padding-top: 0.5em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable rowspacing=\"1em 1em 1em 1em 1em 0.5em\" columnspacing=\"0.278em\" displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Then, we apply the zero product rule to get\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"43\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>or</mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nwhich in turn gives\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"44\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>or</mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the solutions are <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"45\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mj